      "end": 201,
      "source_role": "user_intent",
      "quote": "Reopen the Pebble winter map because a new inlet appeared after the survey. The Pebble winter map must mark the shallow inlet. The accepted Pebble pond survey stays closed while the winter map is open."
    },
    {
      "ref": "R0015",
