      "start": 0,
      "end": 292,
      "source_role": "user_intent",
      "quote": "For Pebble, you can send the map only after Sela signs the inlet sketch. For Pebble, permission to send the map also requires that the depth sheet passes reconciliation. Both conditions for permission to send the map in Pebble are necessary because an unmarked inlet misleads the survey crew."
    },
    {
